  "rules": [
    "planning is read-only",
    "only one managed recording session may be active",
    "start requires the exact current plan digest and session type",
    "piano-vocal performance requires the voice gates and exactly one Roland FP-30X ALSA MIDI source",
    "performance MIDI is written directly by the plan-bound arecordmidi binary as an SMPTE 25 fps / 40 ticks-per-frame Standard MIDI File",
    "performance SMF timing has 1 ms nominal file resolution and is neither a musical tempo nor a sample-accurate WAV/MIDI synchronization claim",
    "the take manifest is the last publication step and the only complete-take commit marker",
    "stop and recovery require exact PID, start-time, executable and command-line identity",
    "a partial file is never silently promoted after an unclean worker exit",
    "the final WAV path is never overwritten",
    "production recording consumes one explicitly named mix source rather than guessing upstream nodes",
    "recordings and private receipts remain outside Git"
  ]
